  "body": "[![WhiteSource Renovate](https://app.renovatebot.com/images/banner.svg)](https://renovatebot.com)\n\nThis PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Change | Age | Adoption | Passing | Confidence |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [@algolia/client-search](https://togithub.com/algolia/algoliasearch-client-javascript) | [`4.9.2` -> `4.10.2`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/@algolia%2fclient-search/4.9.2/4.10.2) | [![age](https://badges.renovateapi.com/packages/npm/@algolia%2fclient-search/4.10.2/age-slim)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) | [![adoption](https://badges.renovateapi.com/packages/npm/@algolia%2fclient-search/4.10.2/adoption-slim)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) | [![passing](https://badges.renovateapi.com/packages/npm/@algolia%2fclient-search/4.10.2/compatibility-slim/4.9.2)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) | [![confidence](https://badges.renovateapi.com/packages/npm/@algolia%2fclient-search/4.10.2/confidence-slim/4.9.2)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>algolia/algoliasearch-client-javascript</summary>\n\n### [`v4.10.2`](https://togithub.com/algolia/algoliasearch-client-javascript/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#v4102-httpsgithubcomalgoliaalgoliasearch-client-javascriptcompare41004102)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/algolia/algoliasearch-client-javascript/compare/4.10.0...4.10.2)\n\n-   fix(recommend): export method types ([#&#8203;1287](https://togithub.com/algolia/algoliasearch-client-javascript/issues/1287)) ([95281fe](https://togithub.com/algolia/algoliasearch-client-javascript/commit/95281fe)), closes [#&#8203;1287](https://togithub.com/algolia/algoliasearch-client-javascript/issues/1287)\n-   chore(release): force public access on npm release ([#&#8203;1288](https://togithub.com/algolia/algoliasearch-client-javascript/issues/1288)) ([2fefd78](https://togithub.com/algolia/algoliasearch-client-javascript/commit/2fefd78)), closes [#&#8203;1288](https://togithub.com/algolia/algoliasearch-client-javascript/issues/1288)\n\n### [`v4.10.0`](https://togithub.com/algolia/algoliasearch-client-javascript/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#v4100-httpsgithubcomalgoliaalgoliasearch-client-javascriptcompare4934100)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/algolia/algoliasearch-client-javascript/compare/4.9.3...4.10.0)\n\nThe `@algolia/client-recommendation` is now deprecated, please use `@algolia/client-personalization` instead. If you were using `initRecommendation` from the `algoliasearch` package, please use `initPersonalization` instead.\n\n-   feat(recommend): introduce Recommend API client ([#&#8203;1280](https://togithub.com/algolia/algoliasearch-client-javascript/issues/1280)) ([97ebde6](https://togithub.com/algolia/algoliasearch-client-javascript/commit/97ebde6)), closes [#&#8203;1280](https://togithub.com/algolia/algoliasearch-client-javascript/issues/1280) [#&#8203;1278](https://togithub.com/algolia/algoliasearch-client-javascript/issues/1278)\n-   feat(personalization): deprecate client-recommendation ([#&#8203;1278](https://togithub.com/algolia/algoliasearch-client-javascript/issues/1278))\n-   fix(rules): automaticOptionalFacetFilters type takes the same input as automaticFacetFilters ([#&#8203;1279](https://togithub.com/algolia/algoliasearch-client-javascript/issues/1279)) ([831a3de](https://togithub.com/algolia/algoliasearch-client-javascript/commit/831a3de)), closes [#&#8203;1279](https://togithub.com/algolia/algoliasearch-client-javascript/issues/1279)\n\n### [`v4.9.3`](https://togithub.com/algolia/algoliasearch-client-javascript/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#v493-httpsgithubcomalgoliaalgoliasearch-client-javascriptcompare492493)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/algolia/algoliasearch-client-javascript/compare/4.9.2...4.9.3)\n\n-   fix(ts): make all keys in facetOrdering optional ([d772f98](https://togithub.com/algolia/algoliasearch-client-javascript/commit/d772f98))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Disabled due to failing status checks.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is behind base branch, or you tick the rebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box.\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [WhiteSource Renovate](https://renovate.whitesourcesoftware.com). View repository job log [here](https://app.renovatebot.com/dashboard#github/algolia/instantsearch.js).",
